==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 23.33~36.67 seconds<sup>700f~1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn, delay 3~13.33 seconds<sup>90f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Chickful A]] spawns.
**1 [[Chickful A]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 3~13.33 seconds<sup>90f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.07~13.33 seconds<sup>2f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
At the beginning of the stage, stall the Hyppohs with meatshields and try not to hit the base quite yet. Throughout stalling, try and upgrade your [[Worker Cat]] to a decent level in order to summon your stronger cats (such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] or any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]]). Once you have a sizable amount of cash, summon said "stronger cats" and begin attacking the base.

Once the base reaches 90% HP, a Master A. and 2 Chickful As appear. Keep in mind that bringing [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] is not a good idea, as she is outranged by Chickful A. Instead, bring [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon]] and/or [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon]], who outrange all enemies in this stage besides Master A. Once you have a few Dragons deployed, they will slowly chip down the Chickful As. With them defeated, there are little to no threats besides the Master A. to deal with.

